{"id":860843,"title":"05｜怎样运用DeepSeek R1进行文章创作和总结？","content":"本视频讲解了使用DeepSeek R1进行文章创作和总结的方法。首先，介绍了AI写作范式的演变，从模板化设计到推理模型的灵活生成。创建文章时，需掌握两个核心机制：结构化框架先行与分块输出。通过先生成大纲或思维导图，再逐步填充内容，确保逻辑清晰。R1单次输出长度限制为8000个汉字，超过则需分段生成。为避免“AI味”，可指定平台调性或强化背景信息。批量成稿时，采用分阶段内容生成策略，并结合多模态大模型增强可信度。此外，R1还擅长总结，利用自我验证、结构化输出等特性，确保准确性。总结时，分为预处理、处理和后处理三个阶段，精准指令设计是关键。通过这些技巧，DeepSeek R1在文章创作和总结中表现出色。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":398701,"user_name":"Shelly","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2422713,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"75BA35C2737EA6","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/24/f7/b9/f2eec64e.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1741942721,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101000501,"comment_content":"老师好，讲课时的课件方便分享下么？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":2017420,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1e/c8/8c/e81c8f83.jpg","nickname":"王智鹏 Zac","note":"","ucode":"FD7504640C833A","race_medal":0,"user_type":8,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":660237,"discussion_content":"课件下载链接：https://pan.baidu.com/s/1VQFQ_kC9xz85JLlgUHIJOA （提取码: hs88）","content_length":66,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1745912052,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]}]}